OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 120 homes in village set 
OL,4,Ato be refused                          
OL,6,FPlans to create up to 120 homes on the 
OL,7,Fedge of a village in Leicestershire are
OL,8,Fset to be turned down as the area has a
OL,9,F"limited range of services and         
OL,10,Ffacilities".                           
OL,12,FBlaby District Council's planning      
OL,13,Fcommittee is recommended to refuse a   
OL,14,Fplanning application on Thursday from  
OL,15,FMaxi Property Developments to build the
OL,16,Fdevelopment on land north of Leicester 
OL,17,FRoad, Sharnford.                       
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
